---
/**
 * WhyLocalFirstSection
 *
 * Explains the strategic problem before introducing the technical solution.
 * Local-first is presented as optionality, not as an anti-cloud position.
 */
---

<section
  class="section why-local-first"
  id="why-local-first"
  aria-labelledby="why-local-first-title"
>
  <div class="shell">

    <div class="why-heading reveal">
      <p class="section-kicker">WHY LOCAL-FIRST</p>

      <h2 id="why-local-first-title">
        The problem isn't the cloud.
        <strong>It's depending on intelligence you don't control.</strong>
      </h2>

      <p class="why-sub">
        Closed APIs are powerful. The risk is making them your <strong>only execution path</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>


    <div class="dependency-grid">

      <article class="dependency-card reveal">
        <div>
          <span class="dependency-index">01</span>
          <h3>Model lifecycle</h3>
          <div class="dependency-flow">
            <div class="flow-problem-box">
              <span class="pain-tag">PAIN POINT</span>
              <p class="flow-problem">Provider deprecates model</p>
            </div>
            <span class="flow-arrow">↓</span>
            <div class="flow-consequence-box">
              <span class="consequence-tag">RISK</span>
              <p class="flow-consequence">Forced migration + revalidation</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flow-outcome">
          <span>LOCAL-FIRST SOLUTION</span>
          <p>Pin the model. Migrate on your timeline.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="dependency-card reveal">
        <div>
          <span class="dependency-index">02</span>
          <h3>Cost dependency</h3>
          <div class="dependency-flow">
            <div class="flow-problem-box">
              <span class="pain-tag">PAIN POINT</span>
              <p class="flow-problem">Per-token API pricing at scale</p>
            </div>
            <span class="flow-arrow">↓</span>
            <div class="flow-consequence-box">
              <span class="consequence-tag">RISK</span>
              <p class="flow-consequence">Unpredictable recurring costs</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flow-outcome">
          <span>LOCAL-FIRST SOLUTION</span>
          <p>Shift suitable workloads to fixed capacity.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="dependency-card reveal">
        <div>
          <span class="dependency-index">03</span>
          <h3>Data boundaries</h3>
          <div class="dependency-flow">
            <div class="flow-problem-box">
              <span class="pain-tag">PAIN POINT</span>
              <p class="flow-problem">Raw data sent to cloud APIs</p>
            </div>
            <span class="flow-arrow">↓</span>
            <div class="flow-consequence-box">
              <span class="consequence-tag">RISK</span>
              <p class="flow-consequence">Privacy risks & compliance friction</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flow-outcome">
          <span>LOCAL-FIRST SOLUTION</span>
          <p>Keep sensitive processing 100% on-device.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="dependency-card reveal">
        <div>
          <span class="dependency-index">04</span>
          <h3>Exit optionality</h3>
          <div class="dependency-flow">
            <div class="flow-problem-box">
              <span class="pain-tag">PAIN POINT</span>
              <p class="flow-problem">Proprietary API lock-in</p>
            </div>
            <span class="flow-arrow">↓</span>
            <div class="flow-consequence-box">
              <span class="consequence-tag">RISK</span>
              <p class="flow-consequence">High switching cost on terms change</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flow-outcome">
          <span>LOCAL-FIRST SOLUTION</span>
          <p>Build alternative local execution paths.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>

<!-- Clean Evidence Bar (Moved after dark thesis block) -->
    <div class="evidence-block reveal">

      <div class="evidence-grid">

        <article class="evidence-item">
          <strong class="evidence-number">61 days</strong>
          <p>
            Between Claude Opus 4.1's deprecation notice
            and API retirement in 2026.
          </p>
          <a href="https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/resources/model-deprecations" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="evidence-source">Anthropic ↗</a>
        </article>

        <article class="evidence-item">
          <strong class="evidence-number">71%</strong>
          <p>
            Of surveyed Italian IT decision-makers say their organisation
            has an AI-provider exit strategy.
          </p>
          <a href="https://www.redhat.com/en/about/press-releases/red-hat-survey-finds-ai-adoption-soaring-across-italy" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="evidence-source">Red Hat ↗</a>
        </article>

        <article class="evidence-item">
          <strong class="evidence-number">4B</strong>
          <p>
            Qwen3.5-4B reports 79.1 MMLU-Pro
            with a 262k native context window.
          </p>
          <a href="https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="evidence-source">Qwen ↗</a>
        </article>

      </div>

      <p class="evidence-note">
        These signals don't make local AI the answer to every workload.
        They make architectural optionality increasingly worth evaluating.
      </p>


    <!-- Dark Local-first ≠ local-only Thesis Block (Moved before evidence) -->
    <div class="local-first-thesis reveal">

      <div class="thesis-header">
        <p class="section-kicker">LOCAL-FIRST ≠ LOCAL-ONLY</p>
        <h3>
          Use frontier models when you need capability, 
          <strong>not because you have no other choice.</strong>
        </h3>
      </div>

      <div class="thesis-principles">
        <div class="principle-chip">
          <span class="chip-dot dot-teal"></span>
          <span><strong>Local</strong> where sufficient</span>
        </div>
        <div class="principle-chip">
          <span class="chip-dot dot-blue"></span>
          <span><strong>Cloud</strong> where valuable</span>
        </div>
        <div class="principle-chip">
          <span class="chip-dot dot-indigo"></span>
          <span><strong>Portable</strong> by design</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>


<style>
  .why-local-first {
    background: var(--surface-card);
  }

  .why-heading {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .why-heading h2 {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 780px;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 2.5vw, 2.3rem);
    line-height: 1.18;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .why-heading h2 strong {
    color: var(--accent-blue);
  }

  .why-heading > p:last-child {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: var(--space-3) 0 0;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-body);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }


  .dependency-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .dependency-card {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: var(--space-5);
    padding-top: calc(var(--space-5) + 6px);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-top: 3px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.7);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--surface-canvas);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.03);
    transition: transform var(--duration-fast) ease, border-color var(--duration-fast) ease, box-shadow var(--duration-fast) ease;
  }

  .dependency-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-strong);
    border-top-color: #ef4444;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.12);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .dependency-index {
    position: absolute;
    top: -14px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 3px 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--surface-card);
    border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4);
    color: #ef4444;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 850;
    line-height: 1;
    z-index: 2;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .dependency-card h3 {
    margin: 4px 0 var(--space-2);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .dependency-flow {
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .flow-problem-box {
    padding: 6px 8px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.06);
    border-left: 2px solid #ef4444;
  }

  .pain-tag {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.58rem;
    font-weight: 850;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: #dc2626;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .flow-problem {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .flow-arrow {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--ink-subtle);
    line-height: 1;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .flow-consequence-box {
    padding: 6px 8px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.06);
    border-left: 2px solid #f59e0b;
  }

  .consequence-tag {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.58rem;
    font-weight: 850;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: #d97706;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .flow-consequence {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .flow-outcome {
    margin-top: auto;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--surface-blue);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-blue);
  }

  .flow-outcome span {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    font-weight: 850;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--accent-blue);
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .flow-outcome p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }


  .evidence-block {
    margin-top: var(--space-6);
    padding: var(--space-5) var(--space-6);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--surface-muted);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .evidence-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-5);
  }

  .evidence-item {
    padding-right: var(--space-4);
  }

  .evidence-number {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
    color: var(--accent-blue);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 2.4vw, 2.2rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .evidence-item p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .evidence-source {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
    color: var(--accent-blue);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color var(--duration-fast) ease;
  }

  .evidence-source:hover {
    color: var(--accent-blue-light);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .evidence-note {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: var(--space-5) 0 0;
    color: var(--ink-subtle);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }


  .local-first-thesis {
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
    padding: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px) var(--space-6);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #090e1a 0%, #0d1527 50%, #0a1122 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(9, 14, 26, 0.4), 0 0 24px rgba(23, 92, 255, 0.12);
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .local-first-thesis::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 60%;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #38bdf8, transparent);
  }

  .thesis-header {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .thesis-header .section-kicker {
    color: #38bdf8;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    font-weight: 850;
  }

  .thesis-header h3 {
    margin: var(--space-2) 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.2vw, 1.85rem);
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .thesis-header h3 strong {
    color: #38bdf8;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  /* Principles Chips */
  .thesis-principles {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-top: var(--space-5);
  }

  .principle-chip {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 7px 16px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: #e2e8f0;
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    transition: border-color var(--duration-fast) ease, background-color var(--duration-fast) ease;
  }

  .principle-chip:hover {
    border-color: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.4);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .principle-chip strong {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .chip-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .dot-teal { background: #2dd4bf; box-shadow: 0 0 8px #2dd4bf; }
  .dot-blue { background: #38bdf8; box-shadow: 0 0 8px #38bdf8; }
  .dot-indigo { background: #818cf8; box-shadow: 0 0 8px #818cf8; }


  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .dependency-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .dependency-grid,
    .evidence-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .evidence-item {
      padding-right: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
